    <!-- ============ FAQ: ruled list, no boxes ============ -->
    <section id="faq" class="section faq-section reveal" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
      <div class="container faq-grid">
        <header class="faq-head">
          <h2 id="faq-title" class="heading-2">Before you<br> ask in the group chat.</h2>
          <p class="body-6 muted">Something else? <a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@nivasa.in">hello@nivasa.in</a></p>
        </header>

        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary><span class="faq-num caption-3">Q.01</span><span class="title-2">How is the match percentage worked out?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <p class="body-3 muted">Must match answers (room type and smoking) go first: if they clash, you never see each other. Every other habit scores by how far apart your dots are on its ruler. Bedtime counts the most, then cleanliness and study style. The habit you mark as most important counts double for you. Your score for them and theirs for you are combined, so a pair only ranks high if it works both ways.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary><span class="faq-num caption-3">Q.02</span><span class="title-2">Who can see my answers?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <p class="body-3 muted">Only signed in students from your college and hostel, and only as a score and a short summary. Your email stays hidden until you both accept a room request.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary><span class="faq-num caption-3">Q.03</span><span class="title-2">Does this decide my room allotment?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <p class="body-3 muted">No. The hostel office still allots rooms. NIVASA helps you find someone you want to share with, so the two of you can apply together.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary><span class="faq-num caption-3">Q.04</span><span class="title-2">What happens when we both say yes?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <p class="body-3 muted">Send a room request from their row. When they accept, you both see each other's college email so you can talk and put in your hostel application as a pair.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary><span class="faq-num caption-3">Q.05</span><span class="title-2">Can I change my answers later?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <p class="body-3 muted">Yes. Jump back to any question in the quiz and every score updates straight away.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary><span class="faq-num caption-3">Q.06</span><span class="title-2">Do I have to answer everything?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <p class="body-3 muted">No. Skipped questions just don't count, so more answers means a more accurate ranking.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ Final CTA: an empty ruler waiting for your dot ============ -->
    <section class="section cta-section reveal" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 id="cta-title" class="cta-title heading-1">Your dot<br> goes here.</h2>
        <a class="cta-ruler" href="#quiz">
          <span class="cta-track" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="tick" style="left: 0%"></span><span class="tick" style="left: 33.33%"></span>
            <span class="tick" style="left: 66.67%"></span><span class="tick" style="left: 100%"></span>
            <span class="cta-rail"><span class="cta-dot"></span></span>
          </span>
          <span class="cta-label">
            <span class="button-md">Start the room quiz</span>
            <span class="caption-2 muted">13 questions · about 3 minutes · before allotment day</span>
          </span>
          <span class="ph ph-arrow-up-right cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
